# The MD-CNN reproduction. Its code, parameter files and write-up are tracked;
# everything it produces is not.
#
# NOT tracked: training_output/ — the saved Keras models (.pb/.index/.data,
# ~175 MB) and the per-fold AUC / history CSVs. Those are models and results.
#
# Tracked: README.md, scripts/ (the sbatch jobs + merge_cv_auc.py),
# parameter_files/*.txt, and model_training/*.py. That last one is the
# reference code copied verbatim from the authors' working tree — worth having
# in git precisely BECAUSE it is a copy: our single deviation from it
# (start_cv_fold read from the parameter file) is otherwise invisible, and the
# public Big-TB-benchmark copy cannot run on the real data as shipped.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.md
!*.sh
!*.py
!*.txt
